            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 47214,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Morning! On the ward, my day is mostly meds rounds at 8am, breakfast distribution around 8:30, then helping with washes. Afternoons are quieter, mainly observations and helping with snacks. I've added my list to A1.",
