            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 427358,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Same here. A big pain point for me is the handover between shifts. Sometimes information about a child's diet or mood gets lost. Also, cleaning the shared play area feels a bit ad-hoc, there's no set time or checklist.",
