            "speaker_id": 508714,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "From the childcare side, our routine is more fluid. We have structured play from 10-11am, then lunch at 12. A major issue is when a child has a medical appointment that clashes with our group activities. It disrupts them and the other children. I've detailed our schedule in A1.",
