            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M6",
            "speaker_id": 3328,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "Thanks, everyone. These are great inputs. I see a few common themes emerging from A1: meal times, cleaning schedules, handovers, and managing medical needs alongside developmental activities. These seem like the core tasks we must include.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
