            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 508714,
            "reply_to": "M6",
            "text": "I agree. And ensuring there's protected time for play and rest is crucial for their emotional wellbeing, especially for the long-stay children. That should be a non-negotiable part of the routine.",
