            "reply_to": "M10",
            "text": "Okay, let's formalize this. Based on the discussion, our core daily tasks for the integrated routine must include: 1. Medication rounds, 2. Meal/snack times, 3. Personal care/hygiene, 4. Scheduled cleaning of shared spaces, 5. Protected activity/play time, 6. Quiet/rest time, and 7. Shift handovers. Does everyone agree with this list?",
