            "speaker_id": 3328,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, quick update: the pilot for our new integrated routine (A3) will start this coming Monday. Let's do a final check on our supporting documents. @427358 has drafted the Handover Notes Template (A6) for T7. We also need to be clear on how we use the Observation and Incident Log (A7) for T8.",
