            "speaker_id": 427358,
            "reply_to": "M50",
            "text": "Thanks @3328. The handover template A6 is in the folder. It has sections for hygiene, meals, mood, and incidents. My question is about the process. When should we fill this out to make sure it's useful for the next shift?",
            "mentions": [
              3328
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M52",
            "speaker_id": 47214,
            "reply_to": "M51",
            "text": "Good point. If we do it too early, we might miss things. If we do it too late, the next shift is already starting.",
