            "msg_id": "M53",
            "speaker_id": 3328,
            "reply_to": "M52",
            "text": "I suggest we block out the last 15 minutes of our shift to complete the A6 template. Then, the first 5 minutes of the handover should be a quick verbal confirmation with the incoming staff, using the notes as a guide. This ensures nothing is missed. Can we agree on that process?",
